{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的感受描写不如 X 细腻，尤其弱化了具体音型、音色变化和瞬间情绪转折的描绘，音乐与文字的精细对应感有所下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分工比较清楚：左边交代人物经历、想法和行为原因，右边用短词补充感受，听音乐时更容易快速抓住每段重点，也更容易理解人物为什么发生变化。Y 从最初的小心、逐渐亲近、暴露心意、害怕失去到最终不再索求保证，前后因果衔接得更自然。X 的音乐感受更丰富细腻，具体音型和情绪瞬间的描写也更有画面，但信息密度较高，实际扫屏时容易来不及消化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "faf05aa7-53a0-4598-a6e4-3c569e717bb5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T200814695473Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:09:10.392647+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1df4a97a4acb6744557f006e5e66ecd8e3c58b3f19f09e74bb63dcf00f610f52", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at